# Maintainer keys that may sign a lobsters-cli release. Format: ssh allowed_signers.
# One line per maintainer, principal release@cloudlobsters.com, namespace lobsters-cli.
# The installed copy of this file is what `lobsters-cli upgrade` trusts, so a new key gets
# in only through a release signed by an existing one.
# claude-lobsters-cli is the namespace of releases up to the rename (0.2.x and the release
# that moves machines over); drop it once every machine runs 0.3.0 or later.
#
# release@cloudlobsters.com namespaces="lobsters-cli,claude-lobsters-cli" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... <next maintainer> (1Password)
